### VS Code REST Client examples. Start with `npm run dev`.
@base = http://localhost:3001

### Fetch all menu items
GET {{base}}/menu

### Filter menu by category
GET {{base}}/menu?categoryId=cat-1

### Fetch featured menu items
GET {{base}}/menu?isFeatured=true

### Sort items by price descending
GET {{base}}/menu?_sort=-price

### Paginated items (object with `data`)
GET {{base}}/menu?_page=1&_per_page=8

### Fetch cart
GET {{base}}/cart

### Update cart quantity
PATCH {{base}}/cart/cart-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 3}

### Add an item to cart
POST {{base}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{"menuItemId":"food-001","quantity":1,"note":"","addedAt":"2026-10-28T11:00:00Z"}

### Fetch orders sorted newest first
GET {{base}}/orders?_sort=-createdAt

### Fetch pending orders
GET {{base}}/orders?status=pending

### Change order status
PATCH {{base}}/orders/order-024
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"preparing"}

### Fetch restaurant details
GET {{base}}/restaurant

### Create a menu item
POST {{base}}/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"New Test Dish","description":"Demo food","price":120,"categoryId":"cat-1","imageUrl":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?w=900","available":true,"isFeatured":false,"prepTimeMinutes":15,"rating":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-28T11:00:00Z"}
